cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code in published work, please cite the underlying
  physics references (Bosch & Hale 1992 for D-T reactivity) and the
  relevant upstream simulator (FLASH, ESTHER, WarpX, Smilei) that
  produced the input profile. v0.0.1-prelim (2026-08-29): initial scaffold
  + synthetic-shot smoke test. No real-data validation yet.
